From 1098e014cf97b0c794b642a828cc5e027ca8c101 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 11:35:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] files: Add Files, a Material 3 file manager.

Based on Winlator File Manager (wfm) by BrunoSX, MIT License, with a
Material 3 interface: a top app bar with breadcrumbs, a path field and
a search field, an action bar, a navigation drawer, rounded list rows
and tiles with Material symbols, an empty folder state, a circular
progress indicator, the colors of the explorer desktop's scheme, and
Roboto. The menu bar moves to the overflow menu. ISO 9660 and CD
images are read without libcdio. Indonesian strings are added.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019oF8nnfMD8z5Z1MeNXoYS9
