+Fonts and colors of Files (files.exe resources)
+
+files_symbols.ttf, files_symbols_filled.ttf
+    Material Symbols Rounded (Copyright Google LLC, Apache License 2.0), from
+    https://github.com/google/material-design-icons, variablefont/
+    MaterialSymbolsRounded[FILL,GRAD,opsz,wght].ttf: subset to the symbols listed
+    in material.h, instanced at wght 400, GRAD 0, opsz 24 and FILL 0 or 1, and
+    renamed to "Wine Files Symbols" and "Wine Files Symbols Filled".
+
+Text uses Roboto, installed into the Fonts folder by the Material 3 style of
+the explorer desktop, when it is there.
+
+The color schemes in palette.h were computed with Material Color Utilities
+0.4.0 (Copyright Google LLC, Apache License 2.0),
